cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: iEEG Epilepsy Report
abstract: The last step of both epilepsy iEEG workflows (Interictal Biomarker Mapping; Seizure Onset
  Localisation). Reads whatever upstream outputs it is given and writes an offline HTML report with
  channel rankings, channel maps, ROC AUCs against expert labels, seizure onset times, method rankings
  and agreement, the consensus onset zone, QC, and methods with versions, parameters and citations.
  Research use only, not for clinical decisions.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-ieeg-report
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- ieeg
- seeg
- epilepsy
- electrophysiology
- report
- seizure-onset-zone
